# "before" means a priority that is not one of time both in "created before all things" (P1 P4) and in "the Eternity of the Creator Himself is before it" (P5 C). The text marks this itself by denying any time before it, so each claim keeps one sense across its statements.
# "wisdom" is split in S1-S3 between the creating Wisdom and the created wisdom. Every claim here uses only the created wisdom, so that split does not reach any premise or assumption, and none is a bridge.
